                                <h2 class="tr-animate">UAE VAT on every POS receipt</h2>
                                <p class="tr-animate tr-animate-delay-1">Retail in the UAE means a high volume of small VAT transactions. In Odoo, each product carries its tax setting, so every POS receipt shows the VAT amount per line and the order total, whether prices are entered tax-inclusive or tax-exclusive. Odoo's UAE localization provides the standard 5% rate together with zero-rated and exempt treatments, and every sale posts to the ledger automatically when the session is closed.</p>
                                <p class="tr-animate tr-animate-delay-1">That means the figures your accountant reviews come from the same transactions the cashier rang up. There is no re-keying from till reports into a spreadsheet.</p>
                                <p class="tr-animate tr-animate-delay-1"><a href="/accounting-software-uae">See how this connects to the rest of the books: accounting software for the UAE</a></p>
                            </div>
