                                <h2 class="tr-animate">Ready for UAE e-invoicing</h2>
                                <p class="tr-animate tr-animate-delay-1">The UAE is moving businesses to structured electronic invoicing through accredited service providers, on a phased timeline set by the Ministry of Finance and the Federal Tax Authority. For a retailer, the practical work is clean master data: correct tax registration numbers, consistent product and tax codes, and customer records that can be validated.</p>
                                <p class="tr-animate tr-animate-delay-1">Techrise reviews your setup against current guidance, cleans the data that invoices depend on, and plans the integration with you so you are not scrambling when your turn comes. Requirements differ by business size and sales type, so we confirm the details with you during discovery instead of promising a one-size-fits-all switch.</p>
                            </div>
