                                <h2 class="tr-animate">Multi-branch stock and transfers</h2>
                                <p class="tr-animate tr-animate-delay-1">Every store, warehouse and stockroom is a location in Odoo Inventory. You see on-hand quantities per branch and in total, move goods between stores with transfer orders, and receive supplier deliveries against purchase orders. Reordering rules raise a replenishment request when a product drops below the minimum you set for a location.</p>
                                <p class="tr-animate tr-animate-delay-1">Barcode scanning speeds up receiving, stocktakes and picking, and lot or serial numbers cover products that need traceability.</p>
                                <p class="tr-animate tr-animate-delay-1"><a href="/inventory-procurement-uae">Read more about inventory and procurement software for the UAE</a></p>
