                                <p class="tr-animate tr-animate-delay-1">Loyalty points, discount rules, coupons and gift cards are configured once and work at the till and on your online store. You can reward repeat customers, run a time-limited promotion on a product category, or sell gift cards that are redeemed in any branch.</p>
                                <p class="tr-animate tr-animate-delay-1">Because every sale is tied to a customer record, you also get purchase history in the same place your team keeps contact details. That makes targeted offers possible without exporting data to a separate marketing tool.</p>
